<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email Address</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;
      max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; } .header {
      background-color: #059669; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align:
      center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; } .content { background-color:
      #f0fdf4; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; } .button { display:
      inline-block; background-color: #059669; color: white; padding: 15px 30px;
      text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; font-weight:
      bold; } .security-notice { background-color: #fef3c7; border: 1px solid
      #f59e0b; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; } .footer {
      text-align: center; margin-top: 30px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px
      solid #e5e7eb; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="header">
      <h1>📧 Verify Your Email</h1>
      <p>Complete your Smart Invoice registration</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>

      <p>Thank you for registering with Smart Invoice! To complete your account
        setup and ensure you receive important notifications, please verify your
        email address.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>
      </div>

      <div class="security-notice">
        <p><strong>Security Notice:</strong></p>
        <p>If you did not create an account with Smart Invoice, please ignore
          this email. Your email address will not be added to our system.</p>
      </div>

      <p>If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste this link into
        your browser:</p>
      <p><a href="{{verificationUrl}}">{{verificationUrl}}</a></p>

      <p>After verification, you'll be able to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access all Smart Invoice features</li>
        <li>Receive important account notifications</li>
        <li>Get payment reminders and updates</li>
        <li>Recover your account if needed</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Welcome to Smart Invoice!<br />
        The Smart Invoice Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>This verification link is valid for 24 hours. If you need a new
        verification email, please log in to your account.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>